Rāvaṇa reaches golden Śaravaṇa where Puṣpaka stalls --- Mārīca suspects some potent cause --- Nandī forbids passage during Śiva sport --- Rāvaṇa mocks monkey-faced Nandī --- Nandī vows monkeys will destroy his race --- Rāvaṇa lifts mountain blocking Puṣpaka --- Śiva pins his arms with toe --- Rāvaṇa roars shaking three worlds --- Śiva pleased names roarer Rāvaṇa --- Rāvaṇa bows and roams harassing kings
